== Scope and limits

This document covers only those parts of the project and those elements that fall within the engineer's mandate [specify: timber, reinforced concrete, steel and masonry structures, foundations …].

Members without a load-bearing function or that are not part of the structural system (balustrades, suspended ceilings, facade fixings, light partitions, etc.) are not dealt with here. Their verification is the responsibility of the executing contractors, who submit it in a traceable form in accordance with the standards in force.

